Creates a shield of impenetrable stone around you for 7 turns, absorbing up to [196, 233, 261, 284, 304 (TL1-5; WIL 100)] damage.

Your equilibrium will increase by twice the damage absorbed.

When the effect ends, all equilibrium above minimum will be converted to mana in a storm of arcane energy and the cooldown of your Block is reset.

The storm inflicts Arcane damage equal to the converted equilibrium (maximum [150, 267, 357, 433, 500 (TL1-5)]) against everyone around you in a radius [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)].

Also while resting you will passively regenerate [0.25, 0.47, 0.66, 0.84, 1.00 (TL1-5)] mana each turn.

The shield strength will increase with Willpower
